6554498 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "aef36574-d26a-51ae-8adf-50d31d43f76c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554452 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1069 "q-3047" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify $\\sqrt{45{y}^{2}}$ given that $y\\ge 0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "09d71431-cc0e-5153-8350-c0a86eafb77b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554540 #edb/ref 1074 "We first write $45{y}^{2}$ as the product $9{y}^{2}\\cdot 5$ which contains a perfect square $(9{y}^{2}).$ Then, we can separate the product into two separate radicals, one of which can be simplified:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{45{y}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{9{y}^{2}\\cdot 5} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(3y)^{2}\\cdot 5} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(3y)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{5} & = \\\\ |3y|\\cdot \\sqrt{5} & = \\\\ |3|\\cdot |y|\\cdot \\sqrt{5} & = \\\\ 3\\cdot |y|\\cdot \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $y\\ge 0,$ we have $|y|=y,$ and we can simplify further. Therefore, our final answer is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\cdot |y|\\cdot \\sqrt{5} & = \\\\ 3\\cdot y\\cdot \\sqrt{5} & = \\\\ 3y\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1069 "q-29342" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify $\\sqrt{32{a}^{7}{b}^{8}}$ given that $a\\ge 0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "758c8bb2-c32e-5b6a-b65e-f02ce4ad0d8b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554586 #edb/ref 1074 "We first write $32{a}^{7}{b}^{8}$ as the product $16{a}^{6}{b}^{8}\\cdot 2a$ which contains a perfect square $(16{a}^{6}{b}^{8}).$ Then, we separate the product into two separate radicals, one of which can be simplified:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{32{a}^{7}{b}^{8}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{16{a}^{6}{b}^{8}\\cdot 2a} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(4{a}^{3}{b}^{4})^{2}\\cdot 2a} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(4{a}^{3}{b}^{4})^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2a} & = \\\\ |4{a}^{3}{b}^{4}|\\cdot \\sqrt{2a} & = \\\\ |4|\\cdot |{a}^{3}|\\cdot |{b}^{4}|\\cdot \\sqrt{2a} & = \\\\ 4\\cdot |{a}^{3}|\\cdot |{b}^{4}|\\cdot \\sqrt{2a}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA number raised to the power of four is always positive or zero, and the absolute value of any positive (or zero) number is itself, so we have that $|{b}^{4}|={b}^{4}$ and $|{a}^{3}|={a}^{3}.$ Therefore, our final answer is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\cdot |{a}^{3}|\\cdot |{b}^{4}|\\cdot \\sqrt{2a} & = \\\\ 4\\cdot {a}^{3}\\cdot {b}^{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{2a} & = \\\\ 4{a}^{3}{b}^{4}\\sqrt{2a}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554468 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1069 "q-33483" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify $\\sqrt{20{n}^{5}}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f380d0a4-2ab4-5ffd-9f65-88568a9b06d4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554641 #edb/ref 1074 "We first write $20{n}^{5}$ as the product $4{n}^{4}\\cdot 5n$ which contains a perfect square $(4{n}^{4}).$ Then, we can separate the product into two separate radicals, one of which can be simplified:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{20{n}^{5}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{4{n}^{4}\\cdot 5n} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(2{n}^{2})^{2}\\cdot 5n} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{(2{n}^{2})^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{5n} & = \\\\ |2{n}^{2}|\\cdot \\sqrt{5n} & = \\\\ |2|\\cdot |{n}^{2}|\\cdot \\sqrt{5n} & = \\\\ 2\\cdot |{n}^{2}|\\cdot \\sqrt{5n}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA squared number is always positive or zero, and the absolute value of any positive (or zero) number is itself, so we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot |{n}^{2}|\\cdot \\sqrt{5n} & = \\\\ 2\\cdot {n}^{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{5n} & = \\\\ 2{n}^{2}\\sqrt{5n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554671 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554727 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554671 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4793c529-2358-59fb-98fc-407d9b60139f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554671 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554540 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554704 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9070e2ab-f493-5ae1-ae96-aa294b03d716" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554704 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554641 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554727 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554704 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554727 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b80055f6-9aac-5f82-8760-3f10697f55c5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554727 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554586 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
